SUMMARY:Wednesday Morning's Breakfast Rides  Casual Pace Variable Distance
  RSVP
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Richard's back leading 
 the ride this week we will ride to grind and griddle in Ephrata.**\n\n**Ev
 ery Wednesday morning...Ride and eat Yummy breakfast together.**\n\n**Plea
 se do not go on this ride unless you will ride at a casual pace and stay w
 ith the group . We will meet to ride to breakfast at a casual pace. After 
 eating some may split up with some returning to the start and others going
  longer and faster.**\n**Helmets are mandatory\; No ear buds or audible mu
 sic playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tu
 be\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n**To eliminate passing around a 
 pen and paper waiver\, we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP be
 low to join this ride. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the ride i
 f needed. If you do not RSVP you are not covered by the club excess accide
 nt insurance policy\; only club members who RSVP are covered. Being on Mee
 tup does not mean you are a club member. Join here-** [https://www.lancast
 erbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancast
 erbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n**Richard Conner\,
  leader717-572-8480**
