SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU WT - 272 BBQ ride (24R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\n\\*\\*\\*PLEASE NOTE THE START TIME\\*\\*\\*\n\nAn enjoyable ride out t
 o Clay and then on to Ephrata with a little climbing. We will stop at 272 
 BBQ in Ephrata (located on the Warick-Ephrata trail) for lunch. The pace w
 ill be 14 - 16 mph average. Multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5).\n\nThis
  ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one grou
 p. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be supportive
  of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off t
 he back of the last group.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\n[https://ridew
 ithgps.com/routes/52715832](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52715832)\n\nHe
 lmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and a 
 basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a 
 Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. Use this link to join t
 he club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_
 id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_
 id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Con
 duct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.asp
 x?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nand Rules of the Road\n[htt
 ps://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.club
 express.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3142165
 98/
